Notes:
  NOTE | a positive slope means the accumulated prediction drifts away from the truth as the battery ages - the signature of integrating a biased increment over the cycle count. This is the mechanism behind the B0018 collapse, and it is why the monotone projection cannot rescue it: clamping the series does not remove a linear drift.
